{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118132","id":4196780286,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PqY5x","number":118132,"title":"Fix --log-file <path> cmdline segfault","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-02T20:18:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T06:56:12Z","closed_at":"2026-04-30T19:50:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118132","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118132","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118132.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118132.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118115\r\n\r\nWhen initializing the logger, whatever path is specified following the `--log-file` argument is given as-is to the constructor:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3911e0963d39b79a85cb329340c6918397d2d05e/main/main.cpp#L2299-L2314\r\n\r\nWhen the logger tries to create the required directory structure in `RotatedFileLogger::rotate_file()`, the `DirAccess` instance is initialized using `DirAccess::ACCESS_USERDATA`, which points it to the `user://` directory:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/137fa73ed4d71d2e7b3a53e2ab6b2690e1f46149/core/io/logger.cpp#L161-L170\r\n\r\nAs a result, when you pass something like `--log-file new_dir/custom_file.log`, it will create `new_dir` in the userdata directory (unintended, it should be created ~~in the same directory as the executable~~ in the CWD), but `FileAccess` will fail to open `custom_file.log` at the relative path and will return `null`. Calling `detach_from_objectdb()` on a `null` instance crashes and burns.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes sure the path given to the logger constructor is absolute, and adds a safety check before calling the function on the file object.","closed_by":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118132/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}